  "short_description": "<p>Handcrafted from 100% natural rattan, this sunburst wall mirror brings organic warmth and Bohemian elegance to any space. Light, durable, and eco-friendly—ideal for living rooms, entryways, bedrooms, or hospitality decor. Available for B2B wholesale and OEM orders.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">As eco-friendly home decor continues to dominate global design trends, our <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"75\">Handcrafted Rattan Wall Mirrors</b> offer the perfect blend of natural warmth, organic texture, and timeless aesthetic. Designed and produced by <b data-path-to-node=\"3\" data-index-in-node=\"216\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd.</b>, these stunning pieces are crafted to meet the high standards of international retailers, interior designers, and wholesale distributors.</p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"5\">🌟 Why Add Our Rattan Mirrors to Your Wholesale Portfolio?</h3>\n<ul data-path-to-node=\"6\">\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Sustainably Sourced Materials:</b> Hand-woven using 100% natural, eco-friendly rattan, appealing directly to the growing base of eco-conscious consumers.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,1,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Artisanal Quality &amp; Durability:</b> Each frame is meticulously crafted by master Vietnamese artisans, featuring a sturdy build, clean weave finish, and long-lasting durability.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,2,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Versatile Decor Styles:</b> Fits seamlessly into Boho-chic, Scandinavian, Coastal, and Modern Rustic interior themes—ideal for living rooms, entryways, bedrooms, or boutique hotel suites.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,3,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Factory-Direct B2B Pricing:</b> Enjoy competitive wholesale rates that maximize your profit margins while offering premium value to your retail clients.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"6,4,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Custom OEM/ODM Solutions:</b> We offer customizable sizes, frame designs, and finishes to perfectly match your brand’s unique product lineup.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-1415\" src=\"https://vietcraft.vn/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/VH2604-Rattan-mirror-P.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1000\" height=\"1500\" /></p>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"8\">📋 Product Specifications at a Glance</h3>\n<table data-path-to-node=\"9\">\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>Feature</strong></td>\n<td><strong>Specification</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,1,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Material</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,1,1,0\">Natural Rattan Frame + HD Glass Mirror</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,2,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Design Motif</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,2,1,0\">Sunburst / Petal / Flower Accent</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,3,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Color Options</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,3,1,0\">Natural Rattan, Warm Honey, or Custom Stains</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,4,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Ideal Buyers</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,4,1,0\">Wholesalers, Distributors, Boutique Retailers, Hospitality Projects</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"9,5,0,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Export Readiness</b></span></td>\n<td><span data-path-to-node=\"9,5,1,0\">Secure, export-standard packaging tailored for safe international shipping</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h3 data-path-to-node=\"11\">📦 Partner with Vietnam Handicraft Today</h3>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"12\">Expand your sustainable decor collection with high-demand rattan products manufactured directly at the source. We provide flexible order quantities, transparent lead times, and dedicated export support.</p>\n<blockquote data-path-to-node=\"13\">\n<p data-path-to-node=\"13,0\"><b data-path-to-node=\"13,0\" data-index-in-node=\"0\">Request a Catalog &amp; B2B Quote:</b> Contact us today at to request sample orders, wholesale price lists, or to discuss custom manufacturing for your upcoming seasonal collection!</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p data-path-to-node=\"3\">",
